867965e8-5dc5-4419-bf84-b7877b7036f1	RheinBrücke’s Kinetic ERP MEA Cloud Receives Green Certificate from Moro Hub for Sustainable Cloud Adoption	RheinBrücke’s Kinetic ERP MEA Cloud Receives Green Certificate from Moro Hub for Sustainable Cloud Adoption	<br>\nWe are thrilled to announce that RheinBrücke IT Consulting has been awarded the prestigious Green Certificate by Moro Hub, a subsidiary of Dubai Electricity & Water Authority - DEWA, for our commitment to sustainability. We would like to thank Mohammad Bin Sulaiman, CEO of Moro Hub for awarding us this prestigious certificate at GITEX 2024, highlighting RheinBrücke’s dedication to reducing its carbon footprint and aligning with global sustainability goals.\n<br><br>\nAt RheinBrücke, we are committed to leveraging cutting-edge technology to drive innovation while being environmentally responsible. By adopting energy-efficient Green Cloud platform, we are securing scalable, high-performance cloud infrastructure that also supports a greener planet. This recognition highlights the importance of sustainability in technology and the commitment to hosting our Epicor Kinetic ERP MEA Cloud workloads in the government's green data center.\n<br><br>\nWe are honored to receive this recognition and look forward to continuing our sustainable initiatives for a brighter, more sustainable future. We would like to extend our gratitude to Mohammad Bin Sulaiman, Said Abu Saeed Saleem, Dr. Ali Bin Mohammed AlMuwaijei, Arisha P., Vetri Selvan, Sreekanth Ramakrishnan, and Nithish Ramanathan for their invaluable contributions and support in achieving this significant milestone		news	\N	\N	https://fltdymhjpiwnwltazqse.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/news-event-images/news-event-images/1765348393933-51lnc.png	t	2024-11-10 06:33:17.961939+00	2025-12-10 14:13:35.347337+00
579269df-01c6-4592-a707-4ee8707ed0e3	Protiviti and RheinBrücke Collaborate to Optimise eProcurement in the Middle East	Protiviti and RheinBrücke Collaborate to Optimise eProcurement in the Middle East	Protiviti and RheinBrücke Collaborate to Optimise eProcurement in the Middle East		news	\N	\N	\N	t	2022-05-10 06:29:50.238484+00	2025-12-10 14:17:33.726745+00
994d82fc-57c7-40c4-b259-d9c508e79859	RheinBrücke launches its strategic sourcing solution MeRLIN Sourcing	RheinBrücke launches its strategic sourcing solution MeRLIN Sourcing	RheinBrücke launches its strategic sourcing solution MeRLIN Sourcing		news	\N	\N	https://fltdymhjpiwnwltazqse.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/news-event-images/news-event-images/1765348121317-i0fqva.png	t	2020-11-10 06:29:05.912968+00	2025-12-10 14:18:27.475937+00
