0aa57254-d987-4474-a229-0bd66716acb6	Grand Opening of India Development Centre (IDC) in RheinBrücke	Grand Opening of India Development Centre (IDC) in RheinBrücke	<br>\nThe IDC inauguration marks a key milestone for RheinBrücke attended by Vetri Selvan, Managing Partner and Founder of RheinBrücke IT Consulting, Simon Owers, CFO of American Golf and David F., the Head of IT Innovation & Strategy at American Golf. Their presence underscored the significance of this development and strong ties we share with our partners.\n<br><br>\nThis cutting-edge centre reflects RheinBrücke’s unwavering commitment to delivering unparalleled digital transformation solutions and strengthening our partnership with American Golf, showcasing our relentless pursuit of excellence in providing world-class services.\n<br><br>\nAmerican Golf is proudly the second client from the Endless LLP portfolio that RheinBrücke has the honour to serve. We take immense pride in supporting American Golf's ambitious digital transformation program, aiming to empower their business operations with innovative & customised solutions. Our sincere gratitude extends to Simon Owers & David F. for their unwavering support and trust in our expertise.\n<br><br>\nVetri Selvan, Managing Partner and Founder of RheinBrücke IT Consulting, shared his thoughts: "The IDC is a testament to RheinBrücke's global mission to empower businesses like American Golf with innovative digital solutions. This centre reflects our commitment to long-term partnerships and delivering exceptional value to our clients as we enter this exciting new chapter."\n<br><br>\nSimon Owers, CFO of American Golf, expressed his gratitude: "The launch of the IDC in Chennai marks a pivotal step forward in our collaboration with RheinBrücke. This new centre will enhance our operational efficiency and growth potential and I would like to extend my thanks to everyone involved for their hard work in making this a reality."\n<br><br>\nDavid F., Head of IT Innovation & Strategy at American Golf, added: “We’re excited to strengthen our partnership with RheinBrücke through the new IDC. It enhances our ability to deliver innovative, scalable and sustainable digital solutions while ensuring vital 18x7 support for our business. This centre will be instrumental in supporting our long-term IT and operational strategies."\n<br><br>\nWe also extend our heartfelt thanks to James Waterhouse, Operating Partner to Endless LLP, Suresh KLM and Dr Tim Drye from BrandStak for their active participation in the ceremonial lighting of the lamp, making the event even more memorable & auspicious.\n<br><br>\nThis is truly an exhilarating milestone for us & we are filled with anticipation and excitement as we look forward to a promising future with the American Golf IDC! The journey ahead is full of opportunities & we are committed to making the most of this development.\n<br><br>\n<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jChsv9rD-Bs" target="_blank">Click Here to View the video</a>		news	\N	\N	\N	t	2024-11-10 06:32:30.888145+00	2025-12-10 14:15:28.216165+00
8c4e4649-3ee2-40b3-a42d-75b24278cfaa	Establishing our Saudi presence and launch of AIMS partnership	Establishing our Saudi presence and launch of AIMS partnership	<br>\nRheinBrücke established its presence in Saudi Arabia through a new strategic partnership with AIMS. AIMS is a multi-billion-dollar investment holding company headquartered in Jeddah that operates in several sectors, including Investment, Properties, Industrial Trading and Manufacturing, Education, Real Estate, and Hospitality.\n<br><br>\nWe would like to express our sincere appreciation to His Excellency Mohamed Hassan Al Noman, the chairman of the board, Mr. Saleh Abdullah Ibrahim, and the CEO of Business Services, Eng. Tariq Malki, for their tremendous assistance in making this collaboration possible. We also express our gratitude to Mr. Nadeem Zaman, Chief Advisor to the Minister of Investment (KSA), for all the guidance and assistance provided.\n<br><br>\nTheir forethought and vision have started our journey's fascinating, new chapter. Our partnership with AIMS is proof of our constant commitment to providing outstanding experiences and value to our consumers in the Saudi Arabian market.\n<br>		news	\N	\N	https://fltdymhjpiwnwltazqse.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/news-event-images/news-event-images/1765363476073-nswk7o.jpg	t	2023-01-10 06:32:05.563366+00	2025-12-10 14:16:01.538915+00
\.


